@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api/v1
@animalId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@foodId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### --- NUTRICIÓN E INVENTARIO (FOOD & ALIMENTATION) ---

### Listar todos los alimentos
GET {{baseUrl}}/foods
Content-Type: application/json

### Registrar nuevo alimento
POST {{baseUrl}}/foods
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Concentrado Premium",
    "type": "Seco",
    "description": "Alimento balanceado para perros adultos"
}

### Ver registro de alimentación de un animal
GET {{baseUrl}}/animals/{{animalId}}/diet
Content-Type: application/json

### Registrar consumo de alimento
POST {{baseUrl}}/animals/{{animalId}}/diet
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "foodId": "{{foodId}}",
    "count": 500,
    "unit": "g",
    "frequency": "daily",
    "startDate": "2026-04-03",
    "endDate": "2026-05-03",
    "observations": "Dieta estándar para mantenimiento"
}


### --- PRODUCCIÓN (PRODUCTION) ---

### Ver datos de producción de un animal
GET {{baseUrl}}/animals/{{animalId}}/production
Content-Type: application/json

### Registrar nueva métrica de producción (Leche)
POST {{baseUrl}}/animals/{{animalId}}/production
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "milkProduction": 25.5,
    "purpose": "milk",
    "recordDate": "2026-04-03"
}

### Registrar nueva métrica de producción (Peso/Carne)
POST {{baseUrl}}/animals/{{animalId}}/production
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "weight": 450.2,
    "purpose": "meat",
    "recordDate": "2026-04-03"
}


### --- REPRODUCCIÓN (REPRODUCTION) ---

### Ver historial reproductivo de un animal
GET {{baseUrl}}/animals/{{animalId}}/reproduction
Content-Type: application/json

### Registrar evento reproductivo (Celo/Preñez)
POST {{baseUrl}}/animals/{{animalId}}/reproduction
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "reproductiveStatus": "pregnant",
    "breedingType": "insemination",
    "offspringCount": 0
}

### Registrar evento reproductivo (Parto)
POST {{baseUrl}}/animals/{{animalId}}/reproduction
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "reproductiveStatus": "lactating",
    "lastCalvingDate": "2026-04-03",
    "offspringCount": 2,
    "breedingType": "natural"
}
